      "text": "```\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| FRENCH (Français)                                                  |\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Family:      Indo-European → Romance → Gallo-Romance              |\n| Native spkrs: ~77M                                                 |\n| Total spkrs:  ~320M (L1+L2) — official in 29 countries            |\n| Countries:   France, Belgium, Switzerland, Canada (Quebec),        |\n|              large parts of Africa (DRC ~100M speakers)            |\n| Word order:  SVO (strict — less flexible than Spanish)            |\n| Morphology:  Fusional                                              |\n| Tonal:       No                                                    |\n| Gender:      Binary (M/F)                                          |\n| Script:      Latin                                                 |\n| Cases:       None (but object pronouns encode case-like info)      |\n| FSI level:   Category I — ~600-750 hours                           |\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
