        "title": "French - Language Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "NOUNS                    VERBS                     PRONOUNS\n  ------                   -----                     --------\n  All gendered (M/F)       Highly irregular          Subject required\n  Articles crucial         in writing —              (NOT pro-drop)\n  (articles tell you       spoken simplifies         Tu (informal)\n  the gender)                  |                     Vous (formal/plural)\n       |                       v\n       v              3 written tenses in use:\n  le/la/les              présent, passé composé,\n  un/une/des             imparfait\n                         (passé simple = literature only)\n       |                       |\n       v                       v\n  Adjectives agree       LIAISON — consonants\n  (M/F + sing/plur)     link words in speech\n  un beau garçon →      \"les amis\" = [lezami]\n  une belle fille       (s of les pronounced)\n```"
    },
